{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure3:0d44d6becdef6b43","artifact_id":"Figure3","visual_type":"flowchart","description":"A three-stage training flowchart. The left Initialization panel shows training data and a default prompt entering a learning loop, followed by selecting TopK to form an initial prompt set. The center Exploration/Convergence panel shows a best router grouping training data, which enters a learning loop with a prompt set; selecting Top1 produces an updated prompt set. The right side gives a greedy coverage rule for selecting top-K prompts.","components":[{"name":"Initialization","role":"training stage","visual_evidence":"Left panel is titled “Initialization” and contains the initial learning and prompt-selection flow."},{"name":"Training Data (Q&A Pairs)","role":"input data","visual_evidence":"Database icon labeled “Training Data (Q&A Pairs)” appears at the upper left and points to the learning loop."},{"name":"Default Prompt","role":"initial prompt input","visual_evidence":"Document icon labeled “Default Prompt” points downward into the initialization learning loop."},{"name":"Initialization Learning Loop","role":"prompt-learning process","visual_evidence":"Blue rounded rectangle labeled “Learning Loop” receives training data and the default prompt."},{"name":"Select TopK","role":"selection operation","visual_evidence":"Downward arrow from the initialization learning loop is labeled “Select TopK.”"},{"name":"Initial Prompt Set","role":"initialized prompt set","visual_evidence":"Document-stack icon labeled “Initial Prompt Set” appears below the TopK selection."},{"name":"Exploration/Convergence","role":"iterative training stage","visual_evidence":"Center panel is titled “Exploration/Convergence” and contains router grouping, learning, and prompt-update steps."},{"name":"Best Router","role":"routing component","visual_evidence":"Router/network icon labeled “Best Router” feeds the grouping operation."},{"name":"Grouped Training Data","role":"router-partitioned data","visual_evidence":"Stacked table icons labeled “Grouped Training Data” receive the grouping output and point toward the learning loop."},{"name":"Prompt Set","role":"prompt input","visual_evidence":"Document-stack icon labeled “Prompt Set” supplies the exploration/convergence learning loop."},{"name":"Exploration/Convergence Learning Loop","role":"iterative router-prompt learning process","visual_evidence":"Blue rounded rectangle labeled “Learning Loop” receives grouped training data and the prompt set."},{"name":"Select Top1","role":"selection operation","visual_evidence":"Downward arrows from the center learning loop are accompanied by the label “Select Top1.”"},{"name":"Updated Prompt Set","role":"updated prompt output","visual_evidence":"Document-stack icon labeled “Updated Prompt Set” appears below the center learning loop."},{"name":"Greedy Coverage Rule","role":"prompt-selection rule","visual_evidence":"Right side displays equations for p_k, coverage gain Δ(p;S), and the updated selected set S_k."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"Training Data (Q&A Pairs)","relation":"feeds","target_component":"Initialization Learning Loop"},{"source_component":"Default Prompt","relation":"feeds","target_component":"Initialization Learning Loop"},{"source_component":"Initialization Learning Loop","relation":"feeds","target_component":"Select TopK"},{"source_component":"Select TopK","relation":"produces","target_component":"Initial Prompt Set"},{"source_component":"Best Router","relation":"determines grouping for","target_component":"Grouped Training Data"},{"source_component":"Grouped Training Data","relation":"feeds","target_component":"Exploration/Convergence Learning Loop"},{"source_component":"Prompt Set","relation":"feeds","target_component":"Exploration/Convergence Learning Loop"},{"source_component":"Exploration/Convergence Learning Loop","relation":"feeds","target_component":"Select Top1"},{"source_component":"Select Top1","relation":"produces","target_component":"Updated Prompt Set"},{"source_component":"Greedy Coverage Rule","relation":"selects prompts for","target_component":"Initial Prompt Set"}],"findings":["The figure contrasts initialization with an exploration/convergence stage.","Initialization uses a learning loop followed by TopK selection to create an initial prompt set.","The exploration/convergence stage uses a best router to group training data and combines the grouped data with a prompt set in another learning loop.","The center stage selects Top1 to produce an updated prompt set.","The displayed rule greedily chooses p_k by maximizing additional coverage and updates S_k by adding the selected prompt."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-1~39","path_id":"1~39","quote":"Three-stage training design and initialization selection rule."},{"section_id":"sec-1~39","path_id":"1~39","quote":"initialization builds prompt set, exploration alternates router and prompt evolution"},{"section_id":"sec-1~39","path_id":"1~39","quote":"convergence fixes the router for larger-budget prompt learning."},{"section_id":"sec-1~39","path_id":"1~39","quote":"the greedy coverage rule for top-K prompts selection."},{"section_id":"sec-1~11","path_id":"1~11","quote":"Eevee therefore first initializes a diverse prompt set before router learning."},{"section_id":"sec-1~11","path_id":"1~11","quote":"Eevee greedily retains prompts by the rule in Figure 3"}],"confidence":0.98,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"4a12ee28e16d3954c098ac79bb61c0f53f32e03426921350e7f06a386e39ff9b","context_sha256":"c99f6273fb1a24cfdd8ee4aeb065b4af6a7d6d2a914943ae5f0b038ccb40df1f","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","requested_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","resolved_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","prompt_sha256":"4786e6f3681b05b0e475e188f0fbd61e98def58906b98ae8010b07dfd44df596","output_schema_sha256":"ce01a5a23e7881cf450e76df819196e554730dbbea77c8ec1cf7e93a2dc11753","schema_id":"diagram_analysis","stage1_visual_type":"flowchart","prompt_task_sha256":"1dd7985b1567eda8d66c3da3478eab188eb6764f7e1445eb1b1014b72ad08dd6","route_policy_sha256":"897498afc82f7598dc9ebd6687dba16a821e18722262df3e299e45136eed1940","model_binding_sha256":"01208a249b295331443fdc61a0e35c1fe80cfdaea164f7a8d95c94b82517f43c","input_sha256":"43e242084f467dfcd54211351f7bf5ecbbca2614dada8023758b4905f586442d","output_sha256":"88433d2850137cefd3d7375287099d2736d8e7a42b1fb7fad5817e1ccb05aa0e","input_tokens":2500,"output_tokens":1093,"latency_ms":20956},"typed_payload":null,"authoritative":false,"import_eligible":false}